{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryAfterFlatMapping\/throttle(for:clock:latest:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryAfterFlatMapping"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/retryafterflatmapping\/throttle(for:clock:latest:)"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Allows only one element to pass through during each specified interval, emitting either the first or the latest element seen in that period."}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","title":"throttle(for:clock:latest:)","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE8throttle3for5clock6latestAA14AsyncSequencesO8ThrottleVy_xqd__G8DurationQyd___qd__Sbt12_Concurrency5ClockRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO21RetryAfterFlatMappingC","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" co